---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How China AI Hub handles data: no tracking, no cookies, no accounts, and how to contact us."
  type="article"
>
  <article class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Last updated: 2026-09-27</p>

    <h2>What this site is</h2>
    <p>
      China AI Hub (sinoaihub.com) is an independent English-language knowledge platform about
      China's AI ecosystem — models, agents, APIs, companies, pricing, benchmarks and technology.
      It is a reference and research site. It is not an e-commerce site, and it does not require
      registration.
    </p>

    <h2>Data we collect</h2>
    <p><strong>We do not collect personal data.</strong> Specifically:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>No accounts</strong> — the site has no login, registration, or user profiles.</li>
      <li><strong>No tracking</strong> — we run no analytics, advertising, or social-media pixels (no Google Analytics, Hotjar, Clarity, Meta Pixel, or similar).</li>
      <li><strong>No cookies</strong> — we do not set first-party tracking cookies. Our hosting provider (Cloudflare Pages) may use infrastructure-level technical measures (such as its email-protection feature on the contact link) to keep the site operational and secure; these are not used to build user profiles.</li>
      <li><strong>No forms</strong> — the site has no contact forms. The only interactive links are a mail link and a WhatsApp link, both of which leave this site.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Third-party links</h2>
    <p>
      Our footer links to WhatsApp (<code>wa.me</code>) and our email address. If you click the
      WhatsApp button, your conversation takes place on WhatsApp's platform and is subject to
      WhatsApp's own privacy policy — not ours. Official source links throughout the site lead to
      third-party vendor documentation; those sites have their own privacy practices.
    </p>

    <h2>Hosting and server logs</h2>
    <p>
      The site is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. Like most hosts, Cloudflare may keep standard
      technical logs (IP address, user agent, request time) for security and abuse prevention.
      We do not access or combine these logs to identify individuals.
    </p>

    <h2>AI-generated images</h2>
    <p>
      Illustrations on entity pages are AI-generated (labeled in image credits, e.g. "Seedream")
      and contain no personal data.
    </p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>
      The site is a technical reference for professionals and researchers. It is not directed at
      children, and we do not knowingly collect any data from children.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy: Martin.W — <a href="mailto:admin@sinoaihub.com">admin@sinoaihub.com</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
